msgstr ""

#. §0: `P → Q`
#. §1: `¬ P ∨ Q`
#. §2: `rewrite`
#. §3: `rewrite`
#. §4: `rewrite`
#. §5: ```
#. rewrite[Or_comm]
#. ```
#. §6: `∨`
#. §7: `Or_comm`
#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.L01_equiv
msgid "The conditional law says that §0 is logically equivalent to §1. This looks *very* close to that statement. We might start by ***rewriting*** the right-hand side of our goal...\n"
"### ❯ The §2 tactic\n"
"In order to apply ***rewrites*** (or substitutions) in Lean, we use the §3 tactic. 🔍 Check out the entry for §4 in the **Tactics** tab for details. 👉 In this specific case, try\n"
"§5\n"
"This will apply the **Commutative Law** for §6 at the first instance in the goal where it is applicable (namely, the right-hand side in this case). 🔍 Check out the entry for §7 in the **Theorems** tab.\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: GameServer.RpcHandlers
msgid "intermediate goal solved! 🎉"
msgstr ""

