#. §0: `rfl`
#. §1: `(P → Q) ↔ (P → Q)`
#. §2: `rfl`
#. §3: `rfl`
#. §4: ```
#. rfl
#. ```
#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.L01_equiv
msgid "\n"
"### ❯ The §0 tactic\n"
"Our goal is currently §1 ... this is true by reflexitivity! The tactic that clears the goal is §2. 🔍 Check out the entry for §3 in the **Tactics** tab. 👉 In our case, try:\n"
"§4\n"
""
msgstr ""

